<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,initial-scale=1.0,maximum-scale=1.0,user-scalable=no"><meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no"/><title>搜索“斗破苍穹”相关的标题</title><script src="/zd/js/common.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="/zd/css/home.css"></head><body onselectstart="return false"><div class="top"><dl><dt><a href="/" class="g-ico g-ico-back">书城</a><p>搜索</p></dt></dl></div><div class="search-f"><dd><form id="fh" method="get" action="" style="display:block; width:100%;"><p class="nav1 ns_ nav1-new1 nav1-search"><input type="hidden" id="ns_sid" name="sid" value="3" /><a href="" id="ns_3" onclick="shou2(3);return false;" class="c">综合</a><a href="" id="ns_1" onclick="shou2(1);return false;" >找书</a><a href="" id="ns_0" onclick="shou2(0);return false;" >找章节</a><a href="" id="ns_2" onclick="shou2(2);return false;" >找作者</a></p><div style="display:-webkit-box;"><input type="text" placeholder="请输入关键字" maxlength="20" name="k" value="斗破苍穹"><i class="btn-search" onclick="shou1();">搜索</i></div><!-- <div class="ns_"><input type="hidden" id="ns_sid" name="sid" value="3" /><label id="ns_3" onclick="shou2(3);" class="on_">综合</label><label id="ns_1" onclick="shou2(1);" >找书</label><label id="ns_0" onclick="shou2(0);" >找文章</label><label id="ns_2" onclick="shou2(2);" >找作者</label></div>--><script type="text/javascript">function shou1(){ document.getElementById("fh").submit(); } function shou2(id){ document.getElementById("ns_sid").value=id; for(var i=0;i<=3;i++){ var o=document.getElementById("ns_"+i); var c=''; if (i==id) c='c'; o.className=c; } document.getElementById("fh").submit(); } </script></form></dd></div><div class="box"><b class="b1">搜索书名“斗破苍穹” - 按结果自然排序</b><ul id="j" class="u1 lazy p"><li><p>抱歉，无相关作品……</p></li></ul><p id="pg"></p><script>foot()</script></body></html>